y &= 2\left(-\frac{1}{2}\right)-1 \\
y &= -\frac{1}{2}-1 \\
y &= -\frac{3}{2}
\end{align*}Therefore, the vertex of the parabola is $\boxed{(-\frac{1}{4},-\frac{3}{2})}$.

