x&=3y \\
xy&=150 \\
(3y)(y)&=150 \\
y^2&=50 \\
y&=\sqrt{50}
\end{align*}Now, we can find $x$: \begin{align*}
x&=3y \\
&=3\sqrt{50}
\end{align*}So, the dimensions of the rectangle are $\boxed{\sqrt{50}}$ inches by $3\sqrt{50}$ inches.

